# Acquired publisher licence texts: fetched from the URLs pinned in
# LICENSE-MANIFEST.toml, verified against the sha256 pinned there, never
# committed. The pin lives in git; the bytes do not.
#
# This is the same split the opengrep acquisition uses for the opengrep engine
# (eval/tools/opengrep/.gitignore). It is what makes the licence gate's
# evidence the PUBLISHER'S document rather than something Anvil wrote: a file
# that git cannot carry is a file no Anvil commit can author.
LICENSE.full.txt

# The mirrored feed data itself. mirror/ holds licence records and pins; the
# advisory payloads the poller and the bulk bootstrap write land here at runtime and are not part of
# the repository.
tier*/*/data/
*.zip
*.json.gz
